== Attacks and abilities ==
=== Magic attack ===
Creates a 7-meter, 35-degree conical blast that deals 180 [[Damage types#Poison|Poison]] damage. This attack cannot be blocked. It can be used every 8 seconds when within 2–5 meters of a target.

=== Attack ===
Deals 20 [[Damage types#Blunt|Blunt]], 60 [[Damage types#Slash|Slash]] and 16 [[Damage types#Frost|Frost]] damage in a 1.7-meter, 90-degree horizontal arc. It can be used every 2 seconds when within 1.2 meters of a target.

=== Heal ===
Creates an area 4.32 meters in radius that applies a healing effect to the shaman and its allies. It deals no damage. The shaman uses it every 10 seconds when a hurt ally is within 4 meters.

